00:23:04,820 --> 00:23:07,720
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Feeding and food assistance address hunger.

179
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:12,100
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Protective services help people through crisis.

180
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:15,160
