Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ito po, potentially, mababaypas po yun, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

5436
05:01:14,000 --> 05:01:18,180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Well, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, I agree with you, it is not a perfect world.

5437
05:01:18,180 --> 05:01:20,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But we could try to make it a fair world.

5438
05:01:21,640 --> 05:01:25,180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Natutuwa ako that there is a slow transition to institutionalizing.

5439
05:01:25,360 --> 05:01:29,000
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung accessibility of healthcare.

5440
05:01:29,780 --> 05:01:33,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But ang mangyayari ba yan, until such time na ma-improve natin,

5441
05:01:33,660 --> 05:01:37,180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: ma-expand yung coverage ng field health,

5442
05:01:37,820 --> 05:01:45,400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: dun sa mga distrito na iba, sa mga taong hindi ganun kalakas,

5443
05:01:46,820 --> 05:01:49,940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: ibig sabihin nun, pansamantala, tiis-tiis muna sila,

5444
05:01:50,060 --> 05:01:53,420
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: huwag muna silang magkakasakit, hindi muna sila matutulungan.

5445
05:01:53,420 --> 05:01:55,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So ganun na lang.

5446
05:01:55,360 --> 05:01:56,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ang sasabihin natin sa kanila.

5447
05:01:58,440 --> 05:02:04,280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Hindi po, Mr. Speaker, that is why itong mga reforma na ito ay talagang minamadali

5448
05:02:04,280 --> 05:02:10,080
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ng ating Secretary of Health at ng Presidente ng Field Health

5449
05:02:10,080 --> 05:02:18,240
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: para unti-unti talagang maramdaman at itong mga shortcomings ay magawan ng paraan.

5450
05:02:18,240 --> 05:02:22,800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pero ang maganda po ngayon, whether the system is, of course, not perfect,

5451
05:02:23,340 --> 05:02:25,240
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: maraming avenues na po.

5452
05:02:25,360 --> 05:02:27,780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pwedeng puntahan yung ating mga kababayan.

5453
05:02:27,800 --> 05:02:29,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ano pa kaya yung ibang avenues?

5454
05:02:29,320 --> 05:02:32,820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because pilit natin gustong matulungan yung tao.

5455
05:02:32,960 --> 05:02:37,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kaya nga kung ako, kung maaari, ibuhos na lang yung pera sa field health

5456
05:02:37,700 --> 05:02:41,660
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: para direkta na yung tao, wala nang kailangan lapitan, punta sila sa hospital

5457
05:02:41,660 --> 05:02:48,460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: at makukuha nila yung tulong na ipinangako, kagaya ng sinabi mo, ng ating Pangulo.

5458
05:02:48,800 --> 05:02:52,200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Hindi naman kailangan niyan ituro o i-endorse pa ng politiko.

5459
05:02:52,980 --> 05:02:54,780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kung maaaring dumiretsyo na lang sila.

5460
05:02:54,780 --> 05:03:01,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Dahil ang gusto naman natin lahat, may access nila itong tulong na galing sa gobyerno.

5461
05:03:02,140 --> 05:03:04,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero alam natin, hindi nangyayari.

5462
05:03:04,420 --> 05:03:08,180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Maybe nangyayari doon sa mga ibang distrito, pero yung mga iba, sabi ko nga,

5463
05:03:08,320 --> 05:03:11,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: dapat pagdating sa healthcare, wala saan ng politika.

5464
05:03:11,360 --> 05:03:15,040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Gusto natin matulungan yung taong nangangailangan ng tulong.

5465
05:03:15,860 --> 05:03:19,080
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: I agree, Mr. Speaker, with our colleague.

5466
05:03:19,080 --> 05:03:24,580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And kahit kasi ibuhos natin itong pondo ng MAIFIP,

5467
05:03:24,780 --> 05:03:27,260
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: napakalaki rin po sa PhilHealth,

5468
05:03:27,840 --> 05:03:31,700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: hindi po kasi overnight na-expand yung mga packages.

5469
05:03:32,000 --> 05:03:32,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: It takes time.

5470
05:03:32,940 --> 05:03:37,500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And I've mentioned the roadmap in the expansion of packages.

5471
05:03:37,680 --> 05:03:40,560
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Dahil ito po ipinag-aaralan para nang sa ganun,

5472
05:03:40,980 --> 05:03:47,240
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: once may offer, ay walang maging problema sa mga members and beneficiaries.

5473
05:03:47,680 --> 05:03:50,960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kaya ngayon, habang in-expand ng PhilHealth,

5474
05:03:51,840 --> 05:03:54,500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at nilalakihan ang supposedly na,

5475
05:03:54,780 --> 05:03:57,280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: na koleksyon ng PhilHealth,

5476
05:03:57,860 --> 05:04:03,120
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: meron pong napupuntahan yung ating mga mamamayan na ibang avenues.

5477
05:04:03,740 --> 05:04:05,740
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ito nga po yung sa MAIFIP,

5478
05:04:06,180 --> 05:04:13,780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: nang sa ganun, ay madagdagan habang lumalaki yung package coverage ng PhilHealth.

5479
05:04:14,520 --> 05:04:14,820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay.

5480
05:04:14,820 --> 05:04:19,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: As I mentioned, yung sa akin lang naman is,

5481
05:04:20,000 --> 05:04:23,680
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: so as not to belabor the point any further,

5482
05:04:24,780 --> 05:04:34,500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: what we wish to accomplish is a universally or a nationally accessible healthcare program

5483
05:04:34,500 --> 05:04:38,420
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: na malalapitan naman ng mga tao na talagang nangangailangan.

5484
05:04:38,960 --> 05:04:41,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Hindi naman natin nilalapit yung mga taong may pambayad eh.

5485
05:04:41,560 --> 05:04:45,280
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ang gusto natin maka-access yung mga taong nangangailangan,

5486
05:04:45,660 --> 05:04:47,840
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: na sana makahingi sila ng tulong.

5487
05:04:48,380 --> 05:04:54,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Hindi yung pinadadala ko pa sa South Cotabato para mabigyan ng tulong yung mga nangangailangan.

5488
05:04:54,780 --> 05:04:56,440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Nangangailangan ng tulong.

5489
05:04:56,940 --> 05:04:58,620
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But the thing is, as I mentioned,

5490
05:04:59,660 --> 05:05:03,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: a sick person, where they live, is a sick person.

5491
05:05:04,180 --> 05:05:05,740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: A sick, needy person.

5492
05:05:06,520 --> 05:05:08,900
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And I hope that they could be able to access it,

5493
05:05:08,900 --> 05:05:15,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: whether directly through the hospitals or indirectly through MAIFIP.

5494
05:05:15,340 --> 05:05:18,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: If ever it becomes justly distributed,

5495
05:05:19,340 --> 05:05:21,100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: then yun lang ang ating nais.

5496
05:05:22,080 --> 05:05:22,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now,

5497
05:05:24,780 --> 05:05:27,380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: to go further, napansin ko po kasi that yung

5498
05:05:27,380 --> 05:05:29,980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: on the National Mental Health Budget,

5499
05:05:31,280 --> 05:05:33,920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: since, every year since 2025,

5500
05:05:34,360 --> 05:05:38,000
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: it has been reduced significantly from 1.5 billion.

5501
05:05:38,000 --> 05:05:42,220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, there's a very small allocation given to it.

5502
05:05:42,500 --> 05:05:44,340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Bakit naging ganun yung alokasyon?

5503
05:05:54,780 --> 05:05:56,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: I'm sorry, Mr. Speaker.

5504
05:05:57,360 --> 05:05:58,180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: May our colleague...

5505
05:05:58,180 --> 05:05:59,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung sa mental health.

5506
05:06:00,320 --> 05:06:00,920
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Oo.

5507
05:06:01,780 --> 05:06:04,740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung sa ating on mental health.

5508
05:06:04,740 --> 05:06:07,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because dati, way back, I think, to 2025,

5509
05:06:07,900 --> 05:06:11,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the budget for mental health was 1.5 billion.

5510
05:06:11,360 --> 05:06:14,840
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, since then, it has drastically been decreased.

5511
05:06:16,160 --> 05:06:17,640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: National Mental Health Budget.

5512
05:06:21,380 --> 05:06:21,940
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Okay.

5513
05:06:22,760 --> 05:06:24,660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, Mr. Speaker,

5514
05:06:24,780 --> 05:06:26,180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: honorable colleague,

5515
05:06:26,920 --> 05:06:28,560
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: yung decrease po ay

5516
05:06:28,560 --> 05:06:31,360
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: hindi dapat mag-alala yung ating mga kababayan

5517
05:06:31,360 --> 05:06:33,240
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: because it will be covered by

5518
05:06:33,240 --> 05:06:34,800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: PhilHealth, itong

5519
05:06:34,800 --> 05:06:37,300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: under their mental health package.

5520
05:06:37,480 --> 05:06:39,340
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Under sa PhilHealth na rin siya ngayon.

5521
05:06:40,340 --> 05:06:40,780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yung,

5522
05:06:40,880 --> 05:06:42,400
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: opo, yung hindi mako-cover.

5523
05:06:42,720 --> 05:06:43,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay.

5524
05:06:43,120 --> 05:06:45,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And, well,

5525
05:06:45,660 --> 05:06:48,200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: to our good sponsor,

5526
05:06:49,120 --> 05:06:49,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: nice ko lang,

5527
05:06:49,900 --> 05:06:51,380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: and to the department,

5528
05:06:52,040 --> 05:06:52,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: well, actually,

5529
05:06:53,320 --> 05:06:53,660
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: we have,

5530
05:06:54,780 --> 05:06:57,400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: there are national government hospitals

5531
05:06:57,400 --> 05:06:59,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: which na kailangan ng tulong.

5532
05:07:00,380 --> 05:07:02,320
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I think I mentioned this before.

5533
05:07:02,320 --> 05:07:04,860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In Quezon City alone,

5534
05:07:04,980 --> 05:07:06,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung Lung Center of the Philippines,

5535
05:07:06,440 --> 05:07:08,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the west wing of Lung Center of the Philippines

5536
05:07:08,560 --> 05:07:12,500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: was burned way back nung, I think,

5537
05:07:13,800 --> 05:07:15,820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 1989.

5538
05:07:16,680 --> 05:07:17,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But up to now,

5539
05:07:18,680 --> 05:07:20,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: hindi pa rin nagagawa.

5540
05:07:21,100 --> 05:07:23,300
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: From a 400 bed capacity,

5541
05:07:23,540 --> 05:07:24,720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: it has been drastically decreased.

5542
05:07:24,780 --> 05:07:25,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Reduced to 170.

5543
05:07:26,320 --> 05:07:28,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sana maisama sa radar yung

5544
05:07:28,700 --> 05:07:31,620
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: pagpapalakita ulit nung hospital.

5545
05:07:32,620 --> 05:07:33,960
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In East Avenue also,

5546
05:07:34,900 --> 05:07:37,320
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: ang East Avenue does not cater only to

5547
05:07:37,320 --> 05:07:39,860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Quezon City or Metro Manila residents.

5548
05:07:40,020 --> 05:07:41,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, galing sa probinsya,

5549
05:07:41,760 --> 05:07:42,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: nagpupunta dyan.

5550
05:07:43,100 --> 05:07:44,860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The bed capacity was 600 before.

5551
05:07:45,000 --> 05:07:46,940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: We were able to increase it to 1,000.

5552
05:07:47,120 --> 05:07:49,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Then from 1,000, we hope na 1,500.

5553
05:07:49,560 --> 05:07:51,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero ang pumupunta na dyan

5554
05:07:51,520 --> 05:07:53,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: na pasyente nila is 1,200.

5555
05:07:53,240 --> 05:07:54,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, eh, sana,

5556
05:07:54,780 --> 05:07:56,580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: tulungan rin ma-expand yung hospital

5557
05:07:56,580 --> 05:07:59,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: so that more people coming from all over

5558
05:07:59,760 --> 05:08:02,040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: could be accommodated by these hospitals.

5559
05:08:10,240 --> 05:08:12,860
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague,

5560
05:08:13,620 --> 05:08:15,840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ito po ay sinusuportahan ng ating

5561
05:08:15,840 --> 05:08:17,980
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Secretary of DOH.

5562
05:08:18,640 --> 05:08:21,780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And aside from possible funds

5563
05:08:21,780 --> 05:08:22,940
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: na makuha from HFEP,

5564
05:08:23,700 --> 05:08:24,760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ay meron din po,

5565
05:08:24,780 --> 05:08:26,860
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: itong retained income earning

5566
05:08:26,860 --> 05:08:29,760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ang Lung Center of the Philippines

5567
05:08:29,760 --> 05:08:31,520
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: na pwedeng pagtulungan

5568
05:08:31,520 --> 05:08:35,020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: upang magawa itong nasunog na wing

5569
05:08:35,020 --> 05:08:36,360
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ng Lung Center.

5570
05:08:36,600 --> 05:08:37,580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yung sa East Avenue,

5571
05:08:37,800 --> 05:08:38,220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: oo kaya.

5572
05:08:40,360 --> 05:08:43,040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There is actually building under construction

5573
05:08:43,040 --> 05:08:44,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: doon na hindi tapos, eh.

5574
05:08:45,320 --> 05:08:47,980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sana matulungan natin na makompleto

5575
05:08:47,980 --> 05:08:49,200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: para matapos yung building.

5576
05:08:49,200 --> 05:08:55,780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Sine-check lang po, Mr. Speaker,

5577
05:08:55,780 --> 05:08:57,660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Honorable Colleague, kung kasama po doon

5578
05:08:57,660 --> 05:09:00,280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: sa HFEP proposal for 2027.

5579
05:09:00,280 --> 05:09:02,080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay. Now, mentioning the HFEP,

5580
05:09:02,080 --> 05:09:03,980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: ah, in fact, I raised this before,

5581
05:09:03,980 --> 05:09:06,580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: HFEP utilization, nung actually,

5582
05:09:06,580 --> 05:09:10,420
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: nung nagawa na ng facility was 30,

5583
05:09:10,420 --> 05:09:11,780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I think, if I remember correctly,

5584
05:09:11,780 --> 05:09:14,200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 33 percent out of the 600 na nagawa,

5585
05:09:14,200 --> 05:09:15,820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: only 200 is being utilized,

5586
05:09:15,820 --> 05:09:16,920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 400 is not being,

5587
05:09:19,060 --> 05:09:19,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: hindi nagawa.

5588
05:09:19,760 --> 05:09:21,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Hindi kasalanan ng DOH siya

5589
05:09:21,260 --> 05:09:23,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: dahil sila lang yung nag-fund ng infrastructure

5590
05:09:23,600 --> 05:09:24,940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: but yung mga LGU,

5591
05:09:24,940 --> 05:09:26,500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: which was supposed to put personnels,

5592
05:09:26,500 --> 05:09:28,440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: medical personnel, health personnel there,

5593
05:09:28,440 --> 05:09:29,780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: hindi naman nila nagawa.

5594
05:09:29,780 --> 05:09:31,980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But, kagaya ng sinabi ko rin,

5595
05:09:31,980 --> 05:09:35,640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: sana ma-improve natin kung paano ibababa yung HFEP

5596
05:09:35,640 --> 05:09:37,820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: dahil, ah,

5597
05:09:37,820 --> 05:09:39,920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: minsan hindi importante yung ano eh,

5598
05:09:39,920 --> 05:09:42,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: minsan naguunahan sa ribbon cutting

5599
05:09:42,880 --> 05:09:46,820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: kahit na ang importante is nagagamit yung facility.

5600
05:09:46,820 --> 05:09:48,780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There are now numerous, ah,

5601
05:09:49,060 --> 05:09:51,360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung mga health centers which are constructed

5602
05:09:51,360 --> 05:09:53,000
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: which is not being utilized.

5603
05:09:53,000 --> 05:09:56,300
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Samantalang may mga lugar na magagamit ito,

5604
05:09:56,300 --> 05:10:00,740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: matatauhan, na hindi naman na nalagyan.

5605
05:10:00,740 --> 05:10:03,100
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: I'd like to remind the honorables

5606
05:10:03,100 --> 05:10:04,840
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: on time to wind up.

5607
05:10:04,840 --> 05:10:05,540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yes.

5608
05:10:05,540 --> 05:10:07,180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

5609
05:10:07,180 --> 05:10:10,180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Tama po kayo, honorable colleague.

5610
05:10:10,180 --> 05:10:13,380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ah, kasalukuyan po, because of that concern,

5611
05:10:13,380 --> 05:10:15,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ay iniimbentaryo ngayon ng DOH

5612
05:10:15,680 --> 05:10:20,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: itong mga, ah, health facilities, ah, under HFEP

5613
05:10:20,680 --> 05:10:24,280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: nang sa ganon, makita ko ano yung mga gaps

5614
05:10:24,280 --> 05:10:25,960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at magamit ito.

5615
05:10:25,960 --> 05:10:28,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And, ah, tama rin po kayo.

5616
05:10:28,600 --> 05:10:32,800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Dahil, kuminsan, siguro excited yung ating mga LGUs

5617
05:10:32,800 --> 05:10:36,540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: na magkaroon ng additional funding from HFEP,

5618
05:10:36,540 --> 05:10:40,580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: kahit na nasa MOA, ay responsibilidad nila.

5619
05:10:40,580 --> 05:10:43,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yung pagpapatakbo nito at yung mga personnel nito ay kuminsan, ah,

5620
05:10:43,680 --> 05:10:46,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: maybe because of fiscal, ah, space,

5621
05:10:46,680 --> 05:10:49,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: hindi nila napopondohan when the time comes.

5622
05:10:49,680 --> 05:10:53,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, ngayon, mas hihigpitan ng ating kalihim

5623
05:10:53,680 --> 05:10:56,700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: after doing the inventory, ah, nang sa ganon,

5624
05:10:56,700 --> 05:11:00,700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: yung mga ready na LGUs talaga ang makapartner ng DOH

5625
05:11:00,700 --> 05:11:03,700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at makarating po ang ating health services

5626
05:11:03,700 --> 05:11:05,700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: sa ating mga local government units.

5627
05:11:05,700 --> 05:11:06,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Well, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

5628
05:11:06,700 --> 05:11:07,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I'm very happy to hear that.

5629
05:11:07,700 --> 05:11:10,680
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ah, sana lang nga, yung, ah, well, yung update lang po sa, ah,

5630
05:11:10,680 --> 05:11:13,680
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: East Avenue, ah, big help yan sa mga pasyente.

5631
05:11:13,680 --> 05:11:14,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: We will submit.

5632
05:11:14,680 --> 05:11:18,680
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And, ah, I would just like to say, Mr., ah, good, ah, Mr. Speaker,

5633
05:11:18,680 --> 05:11:22,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: good sponsor, I'm, I'm very, I'm fully supportive of the budget of the DOH.

5634
05:11:22,700 --> 05:11:27,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, I feel that, ah, we should put more funds, lalong-lalo na sa Universal Health

5635
05:11:27,700 --> 05:11:31,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: to actualize, ah, talagang magamit yung Universal Health Care

5636
05:11:31,700 --> 05:11:34,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: and yung, ah, pagtulong sa ating mga kababayan.

5637
05:11:38,200 --> 05:11:39,360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Maraming salamat po.

5638
05:11:39,360 --> 05:11:40,680
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Yes.

5639
05:11:40,680 --> 05:11:46,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, and we join the Honorable Suntay with his advocacy on health.

5640
05:11:46,700 --> 05:11:48,700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, our distinguished colleague.

5641
05:11:48,700 --> 05:11:49,700
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Majority leader.

5642
05:11:49,700 --> 05:11:58,720
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor, I move that we recognize Representative Sergio Dagooc of APAC Partylist.

5643
05:11:58,720 --> 05:12:01,720
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Honorable Sergio Dagooc is hereby recognized.

5644
05:12:01,720 --> 05:12:05,720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, thank you, majority leader.

5645
05:12:05,720 --> 05:12:09,700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayong hapon sa

5646
05:12:09,700 --> 05:12:17,380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kagalang-galang na sponsor at sa ating Secretary ng Department of Health at sa buong DOH family.

5647
05:12:19,180 --> 05:12:26,420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Paikse lang po ang aking interpellation. Related pa din po sa power yung isa.

5648
05:12:28,780 --> 05:12:35,140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Would the distinguished sponsor yield to a few clarifications?

5649
05:12:35,140 --> 05:12:43,880
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Certainly, Mr. Speaker, lalong-lalo na mula sa ating most respected colleague, kay Congressman Dago.

5650
05:12:44,300 --> 05:12:47,180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Thank you, distinguished sponsor.

5651
05:12:48,720 --> 05:13:00,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon po sa mga project natin sa HPIP, but this does not only happen in the Department of Health.

5652
05:13:01,920 --> 05:13:05,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pareho-pareho po sa DepEd,

5653
05:13:05,140 --> 05:13:12,220
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: sa CAAP, na medyo nagsasayang tayo ng pera.

5654
05:13:12,340 --> 05:13:33,020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: For example, yung mga super health center natin, ang lalaki ng mga transformer, nilakihan yung sino yung ano, anong unit ng DOH yung gumagawa ng plano, napakalaki, 50 kVA.

5655
05:13:33,020 --> 05:13:34,820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, anong implication nito?

5656
05:13:35,140 --> 05:13:39,260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon pa lang sa cost ng transformer, malaki na.

5657
05:13:39,800 --> 05:13:50,140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pag naikabit yan, yung health center, for example, wala namang laman.

5658
05:13:51,120 --> 05:13:52,520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Wala nga ng nurse eh.

5659
05:13:53,040 --> 05:14:00,820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang estimate doon sa 50 kVA ay may X-ray, may kung anu-anong medical equipment.

5660
05:14:00,820 --> 05:14:05,020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero, ang aktual, wala.

5661
05:14:05,140 --> 05:14:17,360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: At kaya, resulta, nagbabayad tayo sa cost ng transformer, nagbabayad tayo sa minimum charge ng transformer na yan, kasi may kontrata yan sa distribution utility.

5662
05:14:18,200 --> 05:14:22,060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Whether na gamit mo yung transformer o hindi, binabayaran yun.

5663
05:14:22,900 --> 05:14:25,760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Then, ang worst, napuputulan.

5664
05:14:25,760 --> 05:14:32,660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Dahil sa laki ng bayarin, hindi kakayanin ng provincial health office.

5665
05:14:33,260 --> 05:14:34,760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi ito, turnover sa...

5666
05:14:35,140 --> 05:14:36,020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: LGU yan.

5667
05:14:36,440 --> 05:14:37,280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: LGU managed.

5668
05:14:37,420 --> 05:14:38,560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, that's one.

5669
05:14:40,000 --> 05:14:50,740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Na, distinguished sponsor, pwedeng tingnan yung mga nationally funded projects na ito na tine-turn over natin sa LGU,

5670
05:14:51,300 --> 05:14:55,640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: dapat tamang-tama lang yung mga transformer na ilagay.

5671
05:14:55,640 --> 05:14:59,640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung maaari nga, i-connect na lang muna natin sa...

5672
05:15:00,000 --> 05:15:03,280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sa common transformer, walang babayaran na minimum.

5673
05:15:03,800 --> 05:15:07,800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Later on, kung may mabili na tayo na gamit, isa ka lang magpakontrata.

5674
05:15:09,200 --> 05:15:13,220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

5675
05:15:14,160 --> 05:15:19,380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Nakita rin po ng ating bagong kalihim ng health, itong problema nito.

5676
05:15:19,960 --> 05:15:25,300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And tama po kayo, yung karamihan po dito ay dapat responsibilidad ng ating local government units.

5677
05:15:25,300 --> 05:15:34,700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pero siguro dahil sa kakulangan din ng pondo, hindi napopondohan yung mga pinirmahan nila under the MOA.

5678
05:15:35,160 --> 05:15:40,880
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kaya ngayon, meron ng prerequisites na gagawin ang Department of Health

5679
05:15:40,880 --> 05:15:52,460
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: para simula pa lang ay mag-garantee na po yung responsibilidad ng ating mga local government units under this program.

5680
05:15:52,460 --> 05:15:54,760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And to add to that,

5681
05:15:54,760 --> 05:15:58,540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: magtatayo na po ng bagong unit under the DOH.

5682
05:15:59,000 --> 05:16:03,720
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ito po ang tinatawag na hospital cluster.

5683
05:16:05,020 --> 05:16:09,880
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At nasa ilalim po nito, itong Health Facility Development Bureau.

5684
05:16:10,320 --> 05:16:11,620
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Sila po yung mga nagde-design.

5685
05:16:12,440 --> 05:16:15,720
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Tapos, lalagyan pa, ito bagong innovation po ito,

5686
05:16:16,100 --> 05:16:20,500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: lalagyan pa na ni Secretary Mercado ng project manager

5687
05:16:20,500 --> 05:16:24,500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: sa central office that will oversee the

5688
05:16:24,760 --> 05:16:31,440
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: the CHDs at yung mga ini-implement na mga HFEP sa local government units.

5689
05:16:31,440 --> 05:16:39,000
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Nang sa ganon, talagang matutukan kung ano lang yung dapat at walang maging wastage and inefficiencies

5690
05:16:39,000 --> 05:16:43,000
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: na nangyayari sa implementation na ito.

5691
05:16:43,000 --> 05:16:52,280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Dahil napaka-kakaunti na lang po ng ating pondo ang hirap akong maraming inefficiencies and wastage.

5692
05:16:52,280 --> 05:16:54,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I think, Distinguished Sponsor,

5693
05:16:54,600 --> 05:17:01,280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: maganda po yung napag-isipang gagawin ng ating bagong Health Secretary.

5694
05:17:01,500 --> 05:17:06,520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero idagdag nyo na lang, bago isama yung project na yan,

5695
05:17:07,180 --> 05:17:10,900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mag-due diligence muna kung yung paglalagyan, may nurse ba,

5696
05:17:11,160 --> 05:17:15,060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: baka building nandun, pero ni isang nurse wala.

5697
05:17:15,660 --> 05:17:19,520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, nandun yung halimbawa medical equipment,

5698
05:17:19,520 --> 05:17:24,580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: eh walang gumagamit dahil alam naman natin yung kakulangan,

5699
05:17:24,600 --> 05:17:28,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nandun naman natin ng doktor at saka nurse, yung anak ko mismo, nurse eh.

5700
05:17:28,600 --> 05:17:30,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, kaya alam ko yung mga yan.

5701
05:17:30,600 --> 05:17:33,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung minsan ako ang nagbabayad para hindi maputulan,

5702
05:17:33,600 --> 05:17:38,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi kakaunti ang gamit, malaki yung binabayaran dahil may minimum nga,

5703
05:17:38,600 --> 05:17:41,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: dahil may transformer na sa linya.

5704
05:17:41,600 --> 05:17:43,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, yan po, yun yung reality.

5705
05:17:43,600 --> 05:17:54,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, pangalawa po, mayroong kuha report regarding dito sa mga medical equipment,

5706
05:17:54,600 --> 05:17:58,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na hindi na-deliver, kung tama itong data ko,

5707
05:17:58,600 --> 05:18:03,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mga 338 contracts ito na worth 242 million.

5708
05:18:03,600 --> 05:18:05,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tama po ba ito, Distinguished Sponsor?

5709
05:18:05,600 --> 05:18:07,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Speaker?

5710
05:18:10,600 --> 05:18:15,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: May we clarify, Mr. Speaker, honorable colleague, kung anong taon po,

5711
05:18:15,600 --> 05:18:19,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: para lang ma-check kaagad yung COA report?

5712
05:18:19,600 --> 05:18:22,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kung meron pong taon?

5713
05:18:22,600 --> 05:18:25,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nakuha lang po namin ito.

5714
05:18:25,600 --> 05:18:38,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang isa pa, if this is correct, yung mga project natin sa HPIP na may delay o hindi natapos,

5715
05:18:38,600 --> 05:18:46,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 488 HPIP infra projects amounting to 17.2 billion.

5716
05:18:46,600 --> 05:18:51,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Please correct me if I'm wrong, kung tama yan.

5717
05:18:51,600 --> 05:19:01,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, for example, in Siargao, mayroon akong isa dyan na nakita sa Socorro na hindi nga natapos.

5718
05:19:01,600 --> 05:19:09,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, dalawang beses na sumulat si Mayor na tulungan ko na lang yung linya para ma-energize yung ano,

5719
05:19:09,600 --> 05:19:12,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi mag-i-inspect na daw yung COA, yung mga ganon.

5720
05:19:12,600 --> 05:19:19,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, kung minsan, I must be candid na sabihin ito,

5721
05:19:19,600 --> 05:19:22,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: para malaman ni sekretary.

5722
05:19:22,600 --> 05:19:29,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung minsan, sinasabi ko, huwag na munang i-hang up, i-connect yung transformer para walang babayaran.

5723
05:19:29,600 --> 05:19:37,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Eh, sasabihin ng DOH or ng contractor, ay kailangan GM,

5724
05:19:37,600 --> 05:19:42,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kailangan para pag-inspect ng COA, tama sa program of work na 50 kVA.

5725
05:19:42,600 --> 05:19:47,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, ang sabi ko na lang, sige, after na ano, para hindi tayo magkapurisyo dyan,

5726
05:19:47,600 --> 05:19:50,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi kung minsan, sa akin din lumalapit na huwag putulan.

5727
05:19:50,600 --> 05:19:55,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sabi ko, after ano, i-disconnect lang natin, ilipat ko kayo doon sa walang transformer.

5728
05:19:55,600 --> 05:19:57,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Basta lang na-inspect na ng COA.

5729
05:19:57,600 --> 05:20:04,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, I'm not saying na there are anomalous, pero medyo mali yung ginagawa natin.

5730
05:20:04,600 --> 05:20:11,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung pundo na very meager, yung hirap na nga yung kongreso pag-allocate kung saan,

5731
05:20:11,600 --> 05:20:14,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: because of the limited fiscal space.

5732
05:20:14,600 --> 05:20:16,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Eh, kung dinisign na lang siya.

5733
05:20:17,600 --> 05:20:18,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sana yun.

5734
05:20:18,600 --> 05:20:20,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: In relation sa issue ko kanina.

5735
05:20:20,600 --> 05:20:34,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, pakicheck lang, distinguished sponsor, Secretary, kung tama yung nabasa ko na mga COA report.

5736
05:20:34,600 --> 05:20:44,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yun lang naman po ang mga issue na yung kailangan para sa akin, kailangan i-address,

5737
05:20:44,600 --> 05:20:46,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi nagsasayang tayo ng pundo.

5738
05:20:46,600 --> 05:20:51,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Magamit pa sana yun sa ibang mga programa natin.

5739
05:20:53,600 --> 05:20:54,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you very much.

5740
05:20:54,600 --> 05:20:59,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: We agree and as mentioned earlier, yung sistema natin dito sa pag-design,

5741
05:20:59,600 --> 05:21:02,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: paglagay ng bagong project manager,

5742
05:21:02,600 --> 05:21:10,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: pagtayo ng bagong unit, itong hospital cluster that will address this.

5743
05:21:10,600 --> 05:21:15,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And the DOH, the Secretary, took note of your comments.

5744
05:21:16,600 --> 05:21:19,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And the problem in that hospital.

5745
05:21:19,600 --> 05:21:28,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: If we may receive more details para mapuntahan po ng ating CHD at maayos po yung mga problema na ito.

5746
05:21:28,600 --> 05:21:30,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sige po, Distinguished Sponsor.

5747
05:21:30,600 --> 05:21:36,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero ang tinutukoy ko po dito, parang tip of the iceberg yung mga yan,

5748
05:21:36,600 --> 05:21:41,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kagaya ng classroom sa DepEd, na this is happening nationwide.

5749
05:21:41,600 --> 05:21:44,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Na mayroon tayong mga building na hindi naman nagagamit.

5750
05:21:44,600 --> 05:21:46,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ginawa lang bodega.

5751
05:21:46,600 --> 05:21:47,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ginawa lang bodega.

5752
05:21:47,600 --> 05:21:54,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ginamit ng ibang klaseng gamit dahil kulang nga tayo ng nurse.

5753
05:21:54,600 --> 05:21:56,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayroon na silang health center.

5754
05:21:56,600 --> 05:21:58,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Dadagdagan pa natin ng super

5755
05:21:58,600 --> 05:22:02,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang tawag natin, di ba tama? Super Health Center.

5756
05:22:02,600 --> 05:22:06,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Paano naging super? Hindi ko alam bakit naging super yun.

5757
05:22:06,600 --> 05:22:12,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Eh wala namang mai-assign doon ng mga medical staff.

5758
05:22:12,600 --> 05:22:21,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So yung mga program na yun, ang titingnan natin, if those buildings are necessary ba talaga?

5759
05:22:21,600 --> 05:22:28,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung sa tingin ko necessary, hindi siguro sa lahat ng lugar, medyo mga piling lugar,

5760
05:22:28,600 --> 05:22:35,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kagaya ng Siargao, hindi lahat ng Siargao kailangan ng super health center.

5761
05:22:35,600 --> 05:22:39,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: General law na maybe, kasi nandun yung mga turista.

5762
05:22:39,600 --> 05:22:41,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So yan yung sabi ko kanina.

5763
05:22:41,600 --> 05:22:48,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Na due diligence muna bago isama sa project listing yung lugar na yan.

5764
05:22:48,600 --> 05:22:56,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Din yung appropriate lang na halimbawa sa power, yung appropriate na laki ng building,

5765
05:22:56,600 --> 05:22:59,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: dipindi sa pangangailangan doon.

5766
05:22:59,600 --> 05:23:06,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi kahit gaano kalaki yun, eh wala namang pasinti doon dahil wala ngang doktor at saka ano.

5767
05:23:06,600 --> 05:23:08,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sayang yung building natin.

5768
05:23:08,600 --> 05:23:10,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

5769
05:23:10,600 --> 05:23:11,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Sekretary.

5770
05:23:11,600 --> 05:23:12,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

5771
05:23:12,600 --> 05:23:17,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker, and to the Honorable Dagooc. Maraming salamat po.

5772
05:23:17,600 --> 05:23:19,600
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Majority Leader.

5773
05:23:19,600 --> 05:23:28,600
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor, I move to recognize Representative Presley C. De Jesus of PHILRECA Partylist.

5774
05:23:28,600 --> 05:23:32,600
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Honorable Presley De Jesus is hereby recognized.

5775
05:23:33,600 --> 05:23:35,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you.

5776
05:23:35,600 --> 05:23:41,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Senior Deputy Speaker, Mr. Speaker, and of course, to my good friend,

5777
05:23:41,600 --> 05:23:43,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the distinguished sponsor.

5778
05:23:43,600 --> 05:23:45,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Most of the questions already been asked.

5779
05:23:45,600 --> 05:23:50,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So ako siguro manifestation at may konting question lang.

5780
05:23:50,600 --> 05:23:53,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito siguro, I don't know if it's been asked already.

5781
