5784
05:24:04,600 --> 05:24:08,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Lalo kung hating gabi, malayo.

5785
05:24:08,600 --> 05:24:23,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Nandiyan na ba tayo? Are we on that stage?

5786
05:24:23,600 --> 05:24:27,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Meron po, Mr. Speaker, honorable colleague.

5787
05:24:27,600 --> 05:24:36,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ito po yung 24/7 NCMH crisis hotline, which is, if I may announce,

5788
05:24:36,600 --> 05:24:42,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 1553.

5789
05:24:42,600 --> 05:24:50,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And it has handled 129,488 calls thus far.

5790
05:24:50,600 --> 05:24:58,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And this has been established since May of 2019.

5791
05:24:58,600 --> 05:25:01,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, of course, Distinguished Sponsor.

5792
05:25:01,600 --> 05:25:06,600
