5793
05:25:06,600 --> 05:25:08,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: O eto, more on ano pa lang.

5794
05:25:08,600 --> 05:25:11,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So do we have a memorandum agreement sa mga private

5795
05:25:11,600 --> 05:25:14,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: or more on ano pa lang yung mga government?

5796
05:25:18,600 --> 05:25:22,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So this hotline is run by DOH, so government.

5797
05:25:22,600 --> 05:25:28,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pero kahit sino po sa ating mga kababayan ay pwedeng tumawag po 24-7.

5798
05:25:28,600 --> 05:25:31,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

5799
05:25:31,600 --> 05:25:35,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: As I point out, kasi ilang bes na akong, siyempre,

5800
05:25:35,600 --> 05:25:39,600
