5801
05:25:39,600 --> 05:25:41,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But for me, MAIP is the best, no?

5802
05:25:41,600 --> 05:25:46,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thanks to DOH family na ito talaga, napaka-importante ito.

5803
05:25:46,600 --> 05:25:48,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ang daming natutulungan na ito.

5804
05:25:48,600 --> 05:25:51,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But may kasamang problema.

5805
05:25:51,600 --> 05:25:54,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Not the DOH itself, no?

5806
05:25:54,600 --> 05:26:00,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Paano natin, how can we do to help our kababayan?

5807
05:26:00,600 --> 05:26:04,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung pagbayad. Kasi some of the doctors, they don't accept yung ano eh.

5808
05:26:04,600 --> 05:26:06,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Hanggang ngayon eh, ilan na yun na.

5809
05:26:06,600 --> 05:26:08,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Misan kami na nag-abono.

5810
05:26:08,600 --> 05:26:10,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kawawang ko. Especially indigent.

5811
05:26:10,600 --> 05:26:13,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Can we have some, like, category?

5812
05:26:13,600 --> 05:26:17,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pag talagang indigent, sana ano na, kahit sino ang doktor na.

5813
05:26:17,600 --> 05:26:20,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Although, private yan, hindi natin maano.

5814
05:26:20,600 --> 05:26:22,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Government, we have no problem.

5815
05:26:22,600 --> 05:26:26,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pero pagdating sa private, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

5816
05:26:28,600 --> 05:26:32,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, for that question.

5817
05:26:32,600 --> 05:26:34,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Talagang problema po yan nationwide.

5818
05:26:34,600 --> 05:26:40,600
