Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng PhilHealth itong top 5 or top 10

7647
06:43:46,960 --> 06:43:48,840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na illnesses. Sana po

7648
06:43:48,840 --> 06:43:50,320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay mapagbigyan nyo kami

7649
06:43:50,320 --> 06:43:52,680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at ma-realize natin po ito.

7650
06:43:53,300 --> 06:43:54,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Let's say,

7651
06:43:54,780 --> 06:43:56,380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: si Z,

7652
06:43:56,380 --> 06:43:57,140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: benefits,

7653
06:43:58,000 --> 06:43:59,260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa breast cancer.

7654
06:43:59,680 --> 06:44:01,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: For example, noong 2025.

7655
06:44:02,640 --> 06:44:04,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can you confirm that the total

7656
06:44:04,340 --> 06:44:05,860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: case amount is

7657
06:44:05,860 --> 06:44:07,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: P239 million?

7658
06:44:08,060 --> 06:44:08,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po ba?

7659
06:44:15,420 --> 06:44:16,300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang

7660
06:44:16,300 --> 06:44:18,960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: accurate figure po,

7661
06:44:19,080 --> 06:44:20,100
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker,

7662
06:44:20,500 --> 06:44:22,060
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Honorable Colleague, is

7663
06:44:28,000 --> 06:44:34,640
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 499.38 million

7664
06:44:34,640 --> 06:44:40,560
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: for 4,145 claims.

7665
06:44:41,440 --> 06:44:42,580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: It is an average

7666
06:44:42,580 --> 06:44:46,060
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: of 120,477

7667
06:44:46,060 --> 06:44:46,620
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: per claim

7668
06:44:46,620 --> 06:44:48,640
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and PhilHealth

7669
06:44:48,640 --> 06:44:50,200
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: pays at most

7670
06:44:50,200 --> 06:44:52,100
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 1.4 million

7671
06:44:52,100 --> 06:44:53,460
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: for breast cancer.

7672
06:44:54,100 --> 06:44:56,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay. So in an average

7673
06:44:56,160 --> 06:44:57,560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: per patient, nasa 1.4 million.

7674
06:44:57,980 --> 06:44:59,440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po.

7675
06:45:00,000 --> 06:45:02,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: P120,000 po on the average.

7676
06:45:02,680 --> 06:45:03,920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: P120,000, salamat.

7677
06:45:03,920 --> 06:45:07,540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pero pwedeng tumaas yung claim up to 1.4 million.

7678
06:45:07,540 --> 06:45:07,940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Up to.

7679
06:45:08,540 --> 06:45:18,180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: There's an article po doon sa 2024 that says PhilHealth can cover up to 1.4 million, gaya ng nasabi niyo po.

7680
06:45:18,180 --> 06:45:32,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa binanggit niyo pong 4,145 claims, cases last year, ilan dyan ang sinagot po ng up to 1.4 million ng PhilHealth?

7681
06:45:32,780 --> 06:45:44,320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Out of the 4,145 claims, tatlo lamang po ang binayaran ng PhilHealth ng 1.4 million cap.

7682
06:45:44,880 --> 06:45:48,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin, napaka-minimal.

7683
06:45:48,180 --> 06:45:59,060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Even sabihin, 0.00001% ang nakaka-claim ng 1.4 na average expenses ng PhilHealth.

7684
06:45:59,700 --> 06:46:09,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May plano ba ang PhilHealth na i-expand ang mga benefit packages at pagandahin ang coverage para sa mga costly diseases?

7685
06:46:09,940 --> 06:46:18,100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Malaking bagay po kasi ito para maibsan naman ang financial burdens ng mga pasyente at kanilang mga pamilya.

7686
06:46:18,180 --> 06:46:22,980
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The answer, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, is yes.

7687
06:46:24,120 --> 06:46:36,160
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: PhilHealth, together with the Philippine Institute for Development Studies, has developed a benefit prioritization framework to guide the evidence-based expansion of benefits.

7688
06:46:36,160 --> 06:46:48,160
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The framework prioritizes conditions with the highest disease burden and financial risk, ensuring that limited resources are directed.

7689
06:46:48,480 --> 06:46:55,760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: where they can deliver the greatest health, impact, and financial protection for our families.

7690
06:46:56,760 --> 06:46:57,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat.

7691
06:46:58,580 --> 06:47:14,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: If I may continue, Distinguished Colleague, nung budget briefing ng DOH, lumabas po ito, ito po yung ginagawa ng ating PhilHealth.

7692
06:47:14,420 --> 06:47:16,120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po dito.

7693
06:47:16,480 --> 06:47:17,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Natanong po po ito.

7694
06:47:18,180 --> 06:47:26,320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kasi gusto ko din pong ma-realize ng PhilHealth at ng DOH and siyempre ng ating mga distinguished colleagues dito sa Kongreso

7695
06:47:26,320 --> 06:47:34,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na ang mga mabibigat na mga sakit kagaya ng cancer, leukemia at iba pang nabanggit ko kanina,

7696
06:47:34,860 --> 06:47:39,740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pag ikaw ay tinamaan yan, most likely hindi ka na makakapagtrabaho.

7697
06:47:40,380 --> 06:47:46,040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At kung hindi ka na makakapagtrabaho, wala ka ng income, wala ka ng pang out of pocket.

7698
06:47:46,040 --> 06:47:55,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya po gusto ko po sana ma-realize ito na sana taasan po po natin or kung maaaring i-zero na po natin

7699
06:47:55,520 --> 06:48:03,880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang babayaran na out of pocket ng ating kababayan patungkol sa mga chronic diseases, yung mga mabibigat na mga diseases.

7700
06:48:04,760 --> 06:48:08,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Anyway, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, maraming salamat po dito.

7701
06:48:10,040 --> 06:48:15,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Noong budget briefing ng DOH at PhilHealth na ibahagi ni Secretary Marquez,

7702
06:48:16,040 --> 06:48:28,140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na from the proposed budget ng PhilHealth na P379B, tanging P73B lang ang pumasok sa 2027 NEP.

7703
06:48:28,700 --> 06:48:37,900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I just want to clarify, ano ang naging basis or batayan ng DOH at PhilHealth sa proposed ng P379B?

7704
06:48:46,040 --> 06:48:55,980
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, inalculate po ng PhilHealth and DOH, itong budget na ito based on payout.

7705
06:48:55,980 --> 06:49:06,780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, from P376B, based on payout, ngayon po nasa P244B.

7706
06:49:08,340 --> 06:49:11,360
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kaya bumaba po, based on payout.

7707
06:49:12,400 --> 06:49:13,460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

7708
06:49:13,460 --> 06:49:14,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, to clarify,

7709
06:49:16,040 --> 06:49:29,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng pre-proposed na P379B, isinama na ba ng DOH at PhilHealth sa calculation ang projected na mga revenues na earmarked by law for UHC,

7710
06:49:30,000 --> 06:49:33,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: particularly doon sa syntax collections natin?

7711
06:49:46,040 --> 06:49:51,580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yes, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, kasama po.

7712
06:49:52,800 --> 06:49:56,180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pero ang nabigay, bariya pa rin. Tama po?

7713
06:49:57,620 --> 06:49:59,220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mababa nga po yung nabigay.

7714
06:49:59,420 --> 06:49:59,720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes.

7715
06:49:59,720 --> 06:50:09,360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: We have a report from DBM na may balance pa ng P140B for universal healthcare mula sa syntax revenues.

7716
06:50:09,920 --> 06:50:13,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: If ever i-release na ito ng DBM to PhilHealth,

7717
06:50:13,820 --> 06:50:15,720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: how would you utilize the P140B?

7718
06:50:16,040 --> 06:50:17,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: P140B po.

7719
06:50:24,420 --> 06:50:33,220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, magagamit po talaga ito sa benefit payout and the expansion of packages ng PhilHealth

7720
06:50:33,220 --> 06:50:37,500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: para mas makapagbigay ng health services sa ating mga kababayan.

7721
06:50:38,260 --> 06:50:39,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

7722
06:50:39,000 --> 06:50:46,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, alam natin lahat na halos bawat pamilyang Pilipino ay may mahalos.

7723
06:50:46,040 --> 06:50:52,740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa buhay o kakilala na lumalaban sa cancer o linggo-linggo ay nagda-dialysis.

7724
06:50:53,420 --> 06:50:56,080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kapag tumama ang ganitong malubhang karamdaman,

7725
06:50:56,540 --> 06:51:03,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: madalas ay hindi na nakakapagtrabaho ang pasyente kaya't nawawalan din ng kita ang pamilya.

7726
06:51:03,500 --> 06:51:09,720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya naman, dapat lamang na mas lakihan pa ng PhilHealth ang sagutin sa mga bayarin.

7727
06:51:09,720 --> 06:51:15,920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At kayang-kaya po itong tustusan sa pamamagitan ng ating syntax.

7728
06:51:16,040 --> 06:51:22,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya sana, hinihiling ko po dito sa ating kongreso na ito'y madagdagan pa.

7729
06:51:23,900 --> 06:51:36,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, ngayon ay dadako naman ako sa mga katanungan na nais ipahatid ng aming Senior Deputy Minority Leader na si Representative Laila Delima.

7730
06:51:36,920 --> 06:51:39,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

7731
06:51:39,300 --> 06:51:46,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: A persistent concern among hospitals nationwide is the challenge of securing additional budget,

7732
06:51:46,040 --> 06:51:54,540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: and resources necessary to meet the level and quality of service delivery expected of them when they are upgraded.

7733
06:51:55,760 --> 06:52:02,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: When a hospital is upgraded, for example, from a Level 2 hospital to a Level 3 hospital,

7734
06:52:02,900 --> 06:52:09,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: who is in charge of requesting from the DBM the additional budget for the necessary plantelia positions?

7735
06:52:10,080 --> 06:52:13,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Is it the DOH or is it the hospital?

7736
06:52:16,040 --> 06:52:35,660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, kapag na-upgrade po yung hospital, sinasubmit po kaagad ito sa DBM ng DOH para yung karapatang pondo ay matanggap.

7737
06:52:36,660 --> 06:52:40,660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pero usually, hindi po overnight nangyayari ito. It takes about...

7738
06:52:46,040 --> 06:52:58,520
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, in 2 to 4 months, natatanggap na po yung NOSCA, pero yung full staffing umabot po ng 3 to 5 years.

7739
06:53:00,120 --> 06:53:08,580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sakaliman po, what is the rate at which upgraded hospitals are provided the updated staffings patterns appropriate for their levels?

7740
06:53:13,580 --> 06:53:15,920
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

7741
06:53:16,040 --> 06:53:25,020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Bulid, kung mamarapatin po, dahil specific na po ito, can the DOH submit the data to the Honorable Delima?

7742
06:53:25,020 --> 06:53:30,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes po. I-inform ko na lang din po si Representative Delima.

7743
06:53:30,820 --> 06:53:31,380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

7744
06:53:32,060 --> 06:53:40,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Susunod po, does it take months or years for hospitals that are upgraded to have additional plantelia positions?

7745
06:53:40,300 --> 06:53:55,800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yeah. Usually po, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, para makumpleto, it takes about 3 to 5 years.

7746
06:53:56,200 --> 06:53:59,400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 3 to 5 years. Salamat po.

7747
06:54:00,000 --> 06:54:04,800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: How long does it usually take for hospitals to secure endorsement from DOH?

7748
06:54:05,000 --> 06:54:10,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Once the request is submitted to DBM, how long does it take for DBM?

7749
06:54:10,300 --> 06:54:14,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: How long does it take for DBM to approve the plantelia positions and release the funds for this?

7750
06:54:19,160 --> 06:54:28,740
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang DOH po, kasabay ng mga batas na ating ginagawa po dito for upgrading and creating hospitals,

7751
06:54:29,340 --> 06:54:35,220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: immediately, once approved, sinasubmit na po ng DOH sa DBM.

7752
06:54:35,220 --> 06:54:40,220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Tapos ang DBM naman po, between 2 to 4 months, ay binibigay natin.

7753
06:54:40,300 --> 06:54:41,420
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Binibigay na po yung NOSCA.

7754
06:54:43,920 --> 06:54:51,080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: As of now po, what percentage of hospitals have staffing patterns that are appropriate to their levels?

7755
06:54:54,260 --> 06:55:07,040
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, kung mamarapatin po ng ating colleague, we will submit kasi kanya-kanyang compliance yung hinihinging data per hospital ng ating kasamahan.

7756
06:55:07,040 --> 06:55:08,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, ayos lang po.

7757
06:55:09,120 --> 06:55:09,440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Thank you.

7758
06:55:09,440 --> 06:55:10,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At ipapaabot din po.

7759
06:55:10,300 --> 06:55:12,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At ipapaabot din po kay Representative Dalim.

7760
06:55:12,040 --> 06:55:12,660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

7761
06:55:13,020 --> 06:55:25,260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: In cases where the facility is under LGU management, does the local government hold the primary mandate to request and finance this new plantelia positions from the DBM?

7762
06:55:26,020 --> 06:55:33,940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Furthermore, does the DOH extend any counterpart financial assistance to support this local health facilities?

7763
06:55:38,420 --> 06:55:39,760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, tama po.

7764
06:55:40,300 --> 06:55:48,960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang mga LGU hospitals, ang LGU po ang nagsasubmit ng plantelia nito sa DBM.

7765
06:55:49,780 --> 06:55:50,740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

7766
06:55:50,740 --> 06:56:03,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At para na lamang po sa huling dalawang katanungan, ito'y patungkol po sa impact of RA 12231 or Government Optimization Act on health workforce.

7767
06:56:04,380 --> 06:56:09,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, in August of last year,

7768
06:56:09,020 --> 06:56:14,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: the Republic Act No. 12231 or the Government Optimization Act was enacted,

7769
06:56:14,780 --> 06:56:22,380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: the law seeks to reorganize, merge, or rationalize redundant executive branch offices.

7770
06:56:23,100 --> 06:56:31,060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Under the law, only teaching and teaching-related positions and military and uniform personnel are excluded.

7771
06:56:32,060 --> 06:56:32,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ito po ang katanungan.

7772
06:56:33,840 --> 06:56:38,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano ang naging epekto ng RA 12231 sa pag-deliver ng frontline personnel?

7773
06:56:39,020 --> 06:56:40,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Public Health Services.

7774
06:57:09,020 --> 06:57:21,940
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: To answer the question, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, ongoing po yung review with the support of the Asian Development Bank on the Organizational Development Consultant.

7775
06:57:21,940 --> 06:57:41,280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pero dahil nga sa laki ng pangangailangan ng healthcare sa ating bansa at sa laki ng kakulangan, most likely, kailangan lumaki pa yung organization and the personnel that serve health in our country.

7776
06:57:41,280 --> 06:57:51,920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po, no? Kaya finally po, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, have the positions of doctors, nurses, and other health workers been updated?

7777
06:57:51,940 --> 06:58:08,240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Have they been affected by this law? While there is indeed a need for optimization to boost bureaucratic efficiency, hindi naman po tama kung maapektuhan ang frontline health services na dapat kailangan-kailangan ng ating mga kababayan.

7778
06:58:08,780 --> 06:58:14,220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dapat exempted din ang ating mga health workers sa optimizations program na ito.

7779
06:58:17,220 --> 06:58:21,220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, most likely, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

7780
06:58:21,940 --> 06:58:39,580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yung implementation po nito, most likely, hindi nga po liliit pero ang increase will be in the frontlines sa regions and on the ground sa mga local government units.

7781
06:58:40,180 --> 06:58:45,880
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pero sa central level, dun po, hindi na po talaga mag-expand.

7782
06:58:46,220 --> 06:58:51,880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, distinguished sponsor. Maraming salamat, Mr. Sponsor.

7783
06:58:51,940 --> 06:59:01,580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, yun na po ang huli kong katanungan at itong representanteng ito ay sumusuporta po sa pag-increase ng budget ng PhilHealth. Maraming salamat po.

7784
06:59:02,540 --> 06:59:09,700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker, at sa ating ginagalang na colleague, kay Honorable Ismula. Maraming salamat po.

7785
06:59:10,180 --> 06:59:10,980
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Majority Leader.

7786
06:59:11,620 --> 06:59:19,660
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Speaker, next to interpolate, I move that we recognize the Honorable Antonio L. Tino of ACT Teachers Partylist.

7787
06:59:20,220 --> 06:59:22,360
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Our last interpellator.

7788
06:59:23,760 --> 06:59:25,200
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Honorable?

7789
06:59:25,200 --> 06:59:25,970
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May isa pa.

7790
06:59:25,970 --> 06:59:30,360
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ah, meron pa ba? Oo. Hindi, [unclear].

7791
06:59:30,360 --> 06:59:33,380
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Second to the last, honorable Antonio Tino.

7792
06:59:33,380 --> 06:59:35,440
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Alam ko naman, short lang ito. Thank you.

7793
06:59:35,880 --> 06:59:46,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. May ilang mga topics po tayo to the sponsor. Simulan na natin. Una po, meron po tayong presentation.

7794
06:59:49,100 --> 06:59:51,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kapos lang po muna, tayin lang natin yung presentation.

7795
06:59:51,940 --> 06:59:58,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Iyan. Okay. So, una tungkol sa maisip.

7796
07:00:00,000 --> 07:00:06,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, I brought this up during the budget briefings and bring it up here again.

7797
07:00:07,640 --> 07:00:15,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sinurvey po natin, on-review yung 10 years, 1 decade worth of MAIFIC plus the proposal for 2027.

7798
07:00:17,000 --> 07:00:22,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang nakikita natin dyan, NEP and GAA side by side.

7799
07:00:22,060 --> 07:00:33,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The blue is the, well, the total bars there are for the DOH, central office pa lang ito, office of the secretary.

7800
07:00:35,360 --> 07:00:40,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And the orange part would be the MAIFIC portion.

7801
07:00:40,760 --> 07:00:50,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, in 2020, unang observation, for 2016 up to 2018,

7802
07:00:52,060 --> 07:01:00,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: more or less, kung ano ang pinropose ng NEP, more or less, not exactly,

7803
07:01:00,800 --> 07:01:03,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero more or less, yun ang aprobahan sa GAA.

7804
07:01:04,540 --> 07:01:08,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero starting in 2019, nakita na natin.

7805
07:01:08,740 --> 07:01:13,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, 2019, this is before the pandemic, so hindi pwedeng pandemic lang ang explanation dito.

7806
07:01:14,340 --> 07:01:19,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2019 to 2026, nakita natin na,

7807
07:01:21,420 --> 07:01:21,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah,

7808
07:01:22,060 --> 07:01:26,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: may significant congressional intervention, let's call it that, no?

7809
07:01:26,940 --> 07:01:35,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig sabihin, dinadagdagan significantly ng kongreso yung budget, as seen in the GAA.

