9384
07:59:57,100 --> 07:59:58,160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Rhythm Society.

9385
07:59:59,120 --> 08:00:00,000
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Napag-aralan na po.

9386
08:00:00,000 --> 08:00:07,760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Natanggap na po ng PhilHealth at kasalukuyang po ang pinag-aaralan.

9387
08:00:08,560 --> 08:00:18,000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kung sakali po bang magiging medically justified yan, magkano ang kakailanganin na additional funding ng PhilHealth para sa 2027?

9388
08:00:19,380 --> 08:00:25,820
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At this point, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, wala pang figure kasi kasalukuyang pinag-aaralan.

9389
08:00:25,820 --> 08:00:30,140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: But PhilHealth can update the Honorable Nassal on this.

9390
08:00:30,360 --> 08:00:35,820
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: But it is a consideration. We are considering expanding the service.

9391
08:00:37,880 --> 08:00:41,760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yeah, well, pinag-aaralan po, Honorable Colleague.

9392
08:00:42,380 --> 08:00:45,040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that, Distinguished Sponsor, Mr. Speaker.

9393
08:00:46,100 --> 08:00:49,820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May I move now to Yakap.

9394
08:00:49,820 --> 08:00:50,400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: To Yakap.

9395
08:00:51,980 --> 08:00:55,820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Speaker, once PhilHealth pays an LGU for its services,

9396
08:00:55,820 --> 08:01:03,120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yakap patients, how do you ensure that money actually improves that health center?

9397
08:01:03,680 --> 08:01:08,540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Doctors, medicines, laboratories, diagnostics, and equipment?

9398
08:01:09,860 --> 08:01:13,200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi po, di ba currently, parang nagmumawa lang yung mga LGU.

9399
08:01:14,000 --> 08:01:24,060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, ang tinatanong lang po natin is, is there an assurance na pag nabayaran na po sila, dumami yung PhilHealth, yung Yakap patients,

9400
08:01:24,060 --> 08:01:31,240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: how will we assure na ito pong mga LGUs will improve on their health centers na ginawa po nilang Yakap Center?

9401
08:01:31,240 --> 08:01:31,320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you.

9402
08:01:44,220 --> 08:01:51,840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, dun po sa mga accredited LGUs na qualified na po or accredited for the Yakap program,

9403
08:01:51,980 --> 08:01:54,040
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: syempre may computation fund po ito.

9404
08:01:54,040 --> 08:02:00,220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And, dapat lamang na yung LGU ginagamit ito to improve their facility.

9405
08:02:01,360 --> 08:02:03,660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, the question po, tama po yun.

9406
08:02:03,960 --> 08:02:07,980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, the question is, how do we assure that they will improve on the facility?

9407
08:02:09,160 --> 08:02:13,160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Is there a change in the contract or the qualification?

9408
08:02:13,420 --> 08:02:20,660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi po, di ba, right now, we allow them to become Yakap, to be accredited as a Yakap facility

9409
08:02:20,660 --> 08:02:23,040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: on the condition that they...

9410
08:02:24,040 --> 08:02:29,740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Have a MOA with either hospitals or diagnostic clinics.

9411
08:02:32,960 --> 08:02:43,060
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Tama po yun, yung mga primary health care centers, pwedeng mag-outsource habang wala pa sila na mga facilities na ito.

9412
08:02:43,060 --> 08:02:52,620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, how long will we allow that until we expect improvement from their own facilities?

9413
08:02:52,620 --> 08:02:58,580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Originally, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, 2027 yung deadline.

9414
08:02:59,060 --> 08:03:03,100
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pero, we understand, iba-iba yung kapasidad ng bawat LGU.

9415
08:03:03,620 --> 08:03:11,140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kaya, some may comply and some may lag behind, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

9416
08:03:14,420 --> 08:03:18,280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Speaker, my next question is, Distinguished Sponsor,

9417
08:03:18,280 --> 08:03:26,080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: do we monitor whether LGU Yakap facilities are actually issuing gamot prescriptions?

9418
08:03:27,200 --> 08:03:32,680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Because kami po, nakikita namin na may patients who cannot access Yakap gamot

9419
08:03:32,680 --> 08:03:38,340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: because the LGU is waiting for its own Yakap gamot accreditation.

9420
08:03:41,600 --> 08:03:48,200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Is an LGU allowed to delay or withhold a medically indicated prescription for that reason?

9421
08:03:48,280 --> 08:03:57,520
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, opo, the answer is yes, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, minomonitor po.

9422
08:03:58,960 --> 08:04:08,900
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And in order to improve the system further, ngayon po, yung mga medicine, ililipat na po dun sa gamot program

9423
08:04:08,900 --> 08:04:18,080
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: para to ensure na may constant and reliable supply because these are relationships with the pharmacy.

9424
08:04:18,080 --> 08:04:25,400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Are we also looking into the possibility of not limiting the prescription coming from Yakap accredited doctors?

9425
08:04:26,260 --> 08:04:32,160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: From PhilHealth, including yung PhilHealth universe na po ng mga doctors?

9426
08:04:32,740 --> 08:04:37,980
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Currently po, kailangan dun sa accredited health provider.

9427
08:04:37,980 --> 08:04:45,100
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Hindi siya pwedeng coming from, tapos mag-avail sa mga accredited doctors ng PhilHealth,

9428
08:04:45,820 --> 08:04:47,400
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: tapos mag-avail na lang sa Yakap.

9429
08:04:48,080 --> 08:04:57,540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pwede pong pag-aralan, pero para may control po tayo sa quality ng service na ibibigay at hindi magka-problema,

9430
08:04:57,940 --> 08:04:59,140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: yun po ngayon yung sistema.

9431
08:05:00,700 --> 08:05:01,140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you.

9432
08:05:01,620 --> 08:05:02,820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that.

9433
08:05:03,060 --> 08:05:04,740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: For everything, Mr. Sponsor.

9434
08:05:04,860 --> 08:05:05,980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

9435
08:05:06,400 --> 08:05:10,780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Maraming salamat po sa DOH and I fully support the budget for 2027.

9436
08:05:10,780 --> 08:05:12,860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker.

9437
08:05:13,460 --> 08:05:18,040
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At maraming salamat sa ating kaibigan, si Honorable Robert Nazal.

9438
08:05:18,940 --> 08:05:23,280
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Maraming maraming salamat, Congressman Robert Nazal of VH Partylist.

9439
08:05:24,580 --> 08:05:25,660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Majority Leader, please.

9440
08:05:26,540 --> 08:05:30,300
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Mr. Speaker, next to interpolate the sponsor, I move to recognize

9441
08:05:30,300 --> 08:05:35,980
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Representative Journey Jet V. Nisay of Pusong Pinoy Partylist.

9442
08:05:37,440 --> 08:05:40,140
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Congressman Nisay, you have the floor, sir. Please proceed.

9443
08:05:40,980 --> 08:05:46,060
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, sa ating buting sponsor, mga ilang katanungan lamang po.

9444
08:05:46,960 --> 08:05:47,760
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker,

9445
08:05:48,080 --> 08:05:48,940
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Sponsor,

9446
08:05:49,580 --> 08:05:54,660
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa DOH budget briefing po ay na-erase na may 36 out of 82 provinces

9447
08:05:54,660 --> 08:05:57,920
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: na walang medical facility managed by DOH.

9448
08:05:59,020 --> 08:05:59,860
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker,

9449
08:06:00,580 --> 08:06:04,600
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: kaugnay po nito may panukalang House Bill No. 11349

9450
08:06:04,600 --> 08:06:07,880
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: o ang Tertiary Hospital in Every Province Act

9451
08:06:07,880 --> 08:06:11,300
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: authored by no less than our Mr. Sponsor himself,

9452
08:06:11,780 --> 08:06:12,420
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: kong Abet,

9453
08:06:12,960 --> 08:06:15,460
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: kasama si na Minority Leader Nonoy Libanan,

9454
08:06:16,000 --> 08:06:17,100
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: kong Gila Garcia,

9455
08:06:17,100 --> 08:06:17,460
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: siya,

9456
08:06:17,880 --> 08:06:19,200
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: kong Shin Gonzales,

9457
08:06:19,660 --> 08:06:20,500
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: at ang inyong lingkod

9458
08:06:20,500 --> 08:06:26,320
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: na naglalayong magkaroon ng at least one DOH supervised tertiary hospital

9459
08:06:26,320 --> 08:06:28,300
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa ating bawat lalawigan.

9460
08:06:29,440 --> 08:06:30,200
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang ating tanong,

9461
08:06:30,780 --> 08:06:33,860
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ay suportado ba o susuportahan po ba ng Department of Health

9462
08:06:33,860 --> 08:06:35,040
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ang panukalang ito?

9463
08:06:35,700 --> 08:06:37,180
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At sa pananaw ng DOH,

9464
08:06:37,900 --> 08:06:42,420
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: paano makakatulong ang pagkakaroon ng at least one DOH managed tertiary hospital

9465
08:06:42,420 --> 08:06:45,800
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: in every province sa pagtugon ng geographic gaps

9466
08:06:45,800 --> 08:06:46,940
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa access to health care?

9467
08:06:46,940 --> 08:06:47,080
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At sa pananaw ng DOH,

9468
08:06:47,100 --> 08:06:49,460
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: at sa pananaw ng higher level government hospital services?

9469
08:06:54,040 --> 08:06:55,840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you for that question,

9470
08:06:56,700 --> 08:06:57,540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker,

9471
08:06:58,300 --> 08:06:59,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Honorable Nisay.

9472
08:07:00,120 --> 08:07:02,300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang sagot po sa inyong katanungan is yes,

9473
08:07:02,900 --> 08:07:09,700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: especially dun sa 36 na wala pa pong DOH hospital na nakatalaga

9474
08:07:09,700 --> 08:07:12,260
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: dun po sa probinsya.

9475
08:07:13,160 --> 08:07:14,100
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker,

9476
08:07:14,480 --> 08:07:15,740
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa atin pong butihing sponsor,

9477
08:07:17,100 --> 08:07:31,800
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mga probinsya po na kasalukuyang walang DOH managed medical facility, mayroon na bang initial assessment ang DOH? Kung alin ang may mga kakayhang matugunan through upgrading or conversion? At alin ang mga mangangailangan talaga ng bagong hospital?

9478
08:07:31,800 --> 08:07:56,920
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, yung nabanggit ko po kanina na innovative solution ng ating sekretary with regards to all these gaps, yung hospital cluster na i-create na magmamanage ng mga CHDs in the region hanggang sa local level,

9479
08:07:56,920 --> 08:08:00,920
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: yun po ang magdedetermine kung ano yung mga strategic options.

9480
08:08:01,800 --> 08:08:10,260
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And surgical, if I may say, interventions na gagawin ng DOH para mapunan kaagad yung mga pagkukulang na ito.

9481
08:08:10,860 --> 08:08:13,020
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Maraming salamat po sa ating buting sponsor.

9482
08:08:13,720 --> 08:08:16,680
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang susunod na katanungan ko po ay may kinalaman sa mental health.

9483
08:08:17,020 --> 08:08:31,100
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ano po ang mga kongkretong gagawin ng DOH para ma-resolve ba ang mahirap at mabagal na repairal system para sa mental health patients, lalo na sa inyong mga nasa malalayong municipalities at provinces?

9484
08:08:46,780 --> 08:08:54,640
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kunin ko lang po yung listahan para sa sagot ng inyong katanungan, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Minister.

9485
08:08:54,640 --> 08:08:55,640
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you.

9486
08:09:43,900 --> 08:09:47,600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, ito po, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Nisay.

9487
08:09:48,440 --> 08:09:54,180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, number one, governance RA-11036 or mental health law.

9488
08:09:55,180 --> 08:10:01,280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Number two, promotion and prevention ng MNS health literacy.

9489
08:10:01,780 --> 08:10:18,160
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yung peer-to-peer, school and workplace-based mental health services, psychological, first aid, MHPSS, and guidelines on ethical portrayal of suicide.

9490
08:10:18,900 --> 08:10:21,500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Number three, ay sa screening.

9491
08:10:22,320 --> 08:10:29,980
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: MNS screening, risk of substance abuse, drug dependency examinations.

9492
08:10:29,980 --> 08:10:30,980
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Number four.

9493
08:10:30,980 --> 08:10:40,020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Number four naman po, sa treatment, MH access program, community-based mental health, community-based drug rehab program.

9494
08:10:40,660 --> 08:10:55,140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Number five, sa financing naman po, inpatient and outpatient benefit package, 432 general mental health providers, and 21 specialty mental health providers.

9495
08:10:55,860 --> 08:11:00,000
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Number six naman po, sa workforce, psychologist.

9496
08:11:00,000 --> 08:11:03,320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Numbering to 2,128.

9497
08:11:03,580 --> 08:11:06,280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Psychiatrist, to 700.

9498
08:11:07,800 --> 08:11:09,800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: DevPed, 104.

9499
08:11:10,980 --> 08:11:14,940
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: SpeechPath, 1,225.

9500
08:11:16,680 --> 08:11:21,200
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: But only at this time in 12 health facilities.

9501
08:11:28,250 --> 08:11:32,000
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At occupational therapist

9502
08:11:32,000 --> 08:11:45,800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: na 3,401 but only to 246 in health facilities in the country. So yun po yung mga efforts na ginagawa ng DOH with regards to mental health.

9503
08:11:45,800 --> 08:11:48,250
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Maraming salamat po sa ating buting sponsor.

9504
08:11:49,000 --> 08:11:55,500
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Kung ang pasyente ay nangailangan ng psychiatric consultation, emergency intervention, o admission,

9505
08:11:55,640 --> 08:11:59,020
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Bakit kailangan pa nilang bumiyahin ng napakalayo o pumunta sa Manila?

9506
08:11:59,020 --> 08:12:17,440
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: May plano po ba ang DOH na mag-establish o mag-upgrade ng mental health units sa bawat probinsyal hospital, magkaroon ng dedicated patient navigation referral system, at magtalaga ng referral focal person sa bawat province para hindi na pamilya mismo ang naghahanap kung saan dadali ng pasyente?

9507
08:12:17,440 --> 08:12:40,500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, kasalukuyan ay nagsiset up ang DOH ng mga mental health specialty center unit in every region consistent with the Regional Specialty Center Act.

9508
08:12:40,500 --> 08:12:45,960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At the same time, dahil it would take some time to set this up,

9509
08:12:46,460 --> 08:12:47,420
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: dun po sa call center,

9510
08:12:47,440 --> 08:12:51,220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: na i-establish ng DOH,

9511
08:12:51,680 --> 08:12:57,120
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ay pwede rin pong tumawag ang may mga pangangailangan with regards to mental health.

9512
08:12:58,040 --> 08:13:00,080
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Maraming salamat sa ating buting sponsor.

9513
08:13:00,700 --> 08:13:03,220
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, sa ating pong buting sponsor,

9514
08:13:03,960 --> 08:13:06,840
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: naniniwala po tayo na prevention is better than cure.

9515
08:13:07,680 --> 08:13:13,320
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Sa ngayon po, mas magandang maagapan muna ang mga may sakit bago lumala, bago natin po gamutin.

9516
08:13:14,060 --> 08:13:17,160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At ngayon po, makikita natin na

9517
08:13:17,160 --> 08:13:25,440
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: medyo tumataas ang non-communicable diseases na kinamamatay ng pamilyang Pilipino.

9518
08:13:26,440 --> 08:13:27,880
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Kung mapapansin po ninyo,

9519
08:13:27,880 --> 08:13:35,260
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ang GAA ng DOH Health Promotion Budget mula 2022 hanggang 2026.

9520
08:13:35,960 --> 08:13:44,120
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang health promotion po noong 2022 na lumabas sa GAA ay P528.7 million plus pesos.

9521
08:13:45,440 --> 08:13:47,140
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Noong 2023, umabot po ng P1.9 billion.

9522
08:13:47,160 --> 08:13:53,060
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At noong 2024, medyo buwaba po, naging P1.7 billion.

9523
08:13:53,760 --> 08:13:58,940
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Noong 2025 naman po, umaba pa rin po, naging P1.4 billion.

9524
08:13:59,860 --> 08:14:03,280
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At ngayong 2026, umabot po ng P1.1 billion.

9525
08:14:04,500 --> 08:14:13,600
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Kung mapapansin po natin, hindi po naabot yung target na 1% allocation pagdating po sa total DOH budget.

9526
08:14:14,600 --> 08:14:16,480
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Paano po natin ginagamit?

9527
08:14:17,160 --> 08:14:25,100
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang pondo ng health promotion at ano po yung mga barriers kung bakit po pababa siya ng pababa?

9528
08:14:43,300 --> 08:14:46,660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague,

9529
08:14:47,160 --> 08:14:58,560
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang ideal ratio po ng pondo na nilalagay for health promotion is around 1% of the entire budget of DOH.

9530
08:14:59,000 --> 08:14:59,920
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, kasalukuyan,

9531
08:15:00,000 --> 08:15:10,860
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: medyo malapit-lapit naman po sa 1%, nasa 0.937%.

9532
08:15:10,860 --> 08:15:16,080
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At itong mga pondo na ito ay ginagamit sa

9533
08:15:16,080 --> 08:15:37,680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: dinagamit sa health governance, policy, and M&amp;E assessment and research.

9534
08:15:37,680 --> 08:15:41,500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, that is 195 million.

9535
08:15:42,840 --> 08:15:45,420
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 751 million sa healthy settings.

9536
08:15:45,420 --> 08:15:49,160
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Support for health communities, schools, and workplace.

9537
08:15:50,380 --> 08:16:00,040
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 468 million sa health literacy, BCS, health campaigns, SBCC, and risk communication.

9538
08:16:00,880 --> 08:16:10,000
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 316 million naman po sa health literacy on MERS and media campaign and partnerships.

9539
08:16:10,000 --> 08:16:15,140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At 60 million po sa operational support, mga JO personnel,

9540
08:16:15,420 --> 08:16:18,540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: operating costs, and farm support.

9541
08:16:22,540 --> 08:16:29,840
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, sa 2027 budget presentation po ng DOH para sa health promotion,

9542
08:16:30,680 --> 08:16:40,540
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: may targets na 2,830 schools, 178 workplaces, and 45 province-wide, city-wide health systems

9543
08:16:40,540 --> 08:16:42,180
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa kasalukuyang budget.

9544
08:16:42,180 --> 08:16:45,180
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Paano naman po sinusukat ng health promotion bureau?

9545
08:16:45,420 --> 08:16:49,180
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Kung ang mga programang ito ay talagang nagpapabago ng health behavior

9546
08:16:49,180 --> 08:16:53,720
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: at hindi lamang nagpaparami ng activities, trainings, at information campaigns?

9547
08:17:01,800 --> 08:17:08,180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Meron pong ginagawa, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, na survey

9548
08:17:08,180 --> 08:17:12,380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: para makita kung umaakyat yung awareness

9549
08:17:12,380 --> 08:17:14,420
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and health consciousness.

9550
08:17:14,420 --> 08:17:15,420
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And health consciousness.

9551
08:17:15,420 --> 08:17:18,240
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At health consciousness ng ating mga kababayan.

9552
